Alembic migrations use DATABASE_URL from backend/.env or the process environment.
From backend/: .venv/bin/alembic upgrade head
Inspect current revision: .venv/bin/alembic current
Metadata: app.models.Base.metadata. Initial revision: 003_restaurants.
Never downgrade a database containing saved entries. Reversibility is tested only
in the randomly named disposable database used by RUN_POSTGRES_TESTS=1 pytest.
